{
  "$comment": [
    "The illustrative 'glass' icons this library ships, by their path under assets/glass-icons/.",
    "These are the 64px illustrations the Figma card puts in a 48px container — a different set from",
    "the MingCute UI glyphs in manifest.json, and not interchangeable with them.",
    "",
    "The set is the October 2026 export, all 100 icons, laid out as the export names them:",
    "`<category>-<name>.dark.svg` becomes assets/glass-icons/<category>/<name>.svg and",
    "`<category>-<name>.light.svg` becomes assets/glass-icons-light/<category>/<name>.svg, so a later",
    "export can be copied over without renaming anything. Every icon has light-canvas artwork.",
    "",
    "A component is named from the file name: capabilities/low-code -> IconGlassLowCode. The one clash,",
    "education/education and industries/education, is settled with an { \"path\", \"as\" } entry.",
    "Run `pnpm glass-icons` after editing."
  ],
